    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ch'en, where are you going?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn it, she just took off running! Who could that have been...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I didn't manage to get a good look either!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that silhouette seemed like...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have to follow her...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
