    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "What bad timing...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "That guy is no ordinary henchman...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "And... where did all of those Originium slugs crawl out from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those creatures... look like they might explode!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}!",
        "tag": "name",
